osed non-bool `int`, `1 <= limit <= 1000000`. The lower bound\n   follows from \"invalid limits\"; the upper bound is a proposed guard with no source in\n   the blueprint.\n4. **Window bounds** — proposed non-bool `int`, `1 <= window_seconds <= 86400`. Same status\n   as the limit upper bound: proposed, not sourced.\n5. **Error codes** — proposed `invalid_limit`, `invalid_window`, `unsupported_schema_version`,\n   `missing_field`, `invalid_policy`. Step 4 requires a *stable denial reason*; if that\n   vocabulary is shared with these validation codes, it should be decided once, here.\n6. **Missing vs. unrecognized version** — proposed `missing_field` when `schema_version` is\n   absent and `unsupported_schema_version` when present but unknown, rather than one code\n   for both.\"\"\"),\n]\nfor a,b in reps:\n    assert a in s, a[:70]\n    s = s.replace(a,b,1)\np.write_text(s)\nprint(\"remaining sections written\")\nOUTER","description":"Fill validation card, rollback, anti-patterns, do-not-touch, open questions"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2548,"cache_read_input_tokens":51100,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2548},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"63460af6-85b1-4ee1-9781-8ece24e10dc3","uuid":"71fce3aa-9f6d-40c7-a0b9-b454487e50be","timestamp":"2026-09-16T02:33:54.339Z","request_id":"req_011Cf6LT4A5XXUhoMAihLwQi","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01UW9uQyYYYrVa9YAJ7oVGYB":{"command":"cd \"/private/var/folders/zf/r0gsd5px2v9_q24j3tfnyb5c0000gn/T/taskspec chat fvp5a5et\" && python3 - <<'OUTER'\nimport pathlib\np = pathlib.Path(\"tasks/T-20260915-rate-limit-policy-schema.md\")\ns = p.read_text()\n\nreps = [\n (\"\"\"  - id: eval_1\n    description: {{EVAL_1_DESCRIPTION}}\n    r